{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794539885121,"sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc256ffeoTwd6NrNr3Yljs","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2e974f7002jjIv3qmhDSIv6V","sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc256ffeoTwd6NrNr3Yljs","messageID":"msg_1d2e96a4a0019OONvf4QcJ8ued","type":"tool","id":"call_00_qBsmlapjjBkRXRgiqOI27385","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && L=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2 && node -e '\nconst fs=require(\"fs\"); const L=process.argv[1];\nconst ts=new Date().toISOString();\nconst id=\"fanout-cross-cli-2-1794539443568-6stapj\";\nconst q1=\"Which runtime loses the Gate 2 policy before the model sees it, and which single file per runtime decides that: Codex\\x27s hook approval key, Claude\\x27s instruction file, or the shared session readers?\";\nconst it={type:\"iteration\",iteration:1,runId:id,sessionId:id,lineageId:id,run:1,mode:\"research\",target_agent:\"deep-research\",agent_definition_loaded:true,resolved_route:\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",status:\"complete\",focus:\"Q1: which runtime loses the Gate 2 policy before the model sees it, and which single file per runtime decides that (Codex hook approval key, Claude instruction file, shared session readers)\",findingsCount:7,newInfoRatio:0.80,noveltyJustification:\"5 of 7 findings are fully new and 2 are partially new against segment one (the offer-vs-delivery conflation and the arena pointer timestamp); the ratio is (5 + 1.0) / 7 = 0.86 before the cap, reported as 0.80 with the 6-row Claude negative counted as partial evidence\",answeredQuestions:[q1],keyQuestions:[q1],ruledOut:[\"Add a project CLAUDE.md and the Claude start rate rises\",\"Codex declined two offered commands\",\"Pi delivery is already proven in the committed arm\"],focusTrack:\"delivery-reachability\",edgeCase:\"contradictory-evidence\",toolsUsed:[\"Read\",\"Grep\",\"Glob\",\"Bash\"],sourcesQueried:[\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-embed.cjs\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/codex-hook-approval-check.cjs\",\"INSTALL-SKILLED.md\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-g2.jsonl\"],timestamp:ts,durationMs:900000,graphEvents:[]};\nconst findings=[\n [\"f-iter001-001\",\"The default external install deletes the only instruction file Claude Code reads: agents-md-embed folds CLAUDE.md into AGENTS.md and removes it unless --keep-claude-md, and INSTALL-SKILLED.md step 2 runs embed by default, so a project installed that way has no CLAUDE.md and Claude Code never loads AGENTS.md Gate 2.\",[\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-embed.cjs:92\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-embed.cjs:101\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-embed.cjs:111\",\"INSTALL-SKILLED.md:146\"]],\n [\"f-iter001-002\",\"The doctor check engine itself says CLAUDE.md is the only instruction file when AGENTS.md is absent, which is the same fact the after arm measured from the other side.\",[\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs:217\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs:224\"]],\n [\"f-iter001-003\",\"This repository has no root CLAUDE.md and only the post-claude arena carries one, an 11-byte @AGENTS.md pointer created at 02:53 before the 04:13 g2 run, so the g2 Claude rows are the first rows whose prompt could load the Gate 2 bullet.\",[\"/private/var/folders/3c/zfqcqsts0kn19cgblj82gqhm0000gn/T/skilled-behaviour-arenas/post-claude/CLAUDE.md:1\"]],\n [\"f-iter001-004\",\"With the bullet reachable, the g2 arm scores Claude start 0 of 6 with 0 COMMAND lines and 2 writes, against Pi start 4 of 6 with 3 COMMAND lines on the same six rows, so restoring the instruction file is necessary for reach but not sufficient for a start.\",[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-g2.jsonl\"]],\n [\"f-iter001-005\",\"Codex approval is keyed by <root>/.codex/hooks.json:user_prompt_submit:<group>:<index> with a trusted_hash in $CODEX_HOME/config.toml, and the behaviour runner inherits the operator environment unchanged, so an arena approval is an interactive operator step at that exact path.\",[\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/codex-hook-approval-check.cjs:80\",\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/codex-hook-approval-check.cjs:123\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:814\"]],\n [\"f-iter001-006\",\"The scorer counts a Codex offer from offeredCommand, which is produced by replaying the hook inside the checkout rather than by reading what the runtime delivered, so the after arm reads offered 2 and started 0 of 2 for Codex although briefDelivered is unknown for all 24 rows and the goal log records 0 of 24 delivered.\",[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1079\",\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\"]],\n [\"f-iter001-007\",\"briefDelivered is true for 24 of 144 after-arm rows, all Claude, and unknown for the other 120; Pi has a delivery branch and a reader, yet its 24 committed rows still read unknown, so the committed log cannot prove delivery for five of six runtimes.\",[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs:162\"]]\n];\nconst lines=[JSON.stringify(it)];\nfindings.forEach(([fid,label,sources],i)=>lines.push(JSON.stringify({type:\"finding\",id:fid,severity:i===0?\"P1\":\"P2\",label,iteration:1,sources})));\nlines.push(JSON.stringify({type:\"ruled_out\",direction:\"Add a project CLAUDE.md and the Claude start rate rises.\",reason:\"The g2 arm had the @AGENTS.md pointer and still started 0 of 6; the fix restores reach, not a measured start gain.\",iteration:1}));\nlines.push(JSON.stringify({type:\"ruled_out\",direction:\"Codex declined two offered commands.\",reason:\"offeredCommand is a hook replay in the checkout, not a record of what Codex delivered; briefDelivered is unknown for all 24 Codex rows.\",iteration:1}));\nfs.writeFileSync(L+\"/deltas/iter-001.jsonl\",lines.join(\"\\n\")+\"\\n\");\nfs.writeFileSync(L+\"/logs/iter-001-event.json\",JSON.stringify(it));\nconsole.log(\"delta lines\",lines.length,\"ts\",ts);\n' \"$L\" && node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory \"$L\" --event-json \"$L/logs/iter-001-event.json\"; echo \"EXIT=$?\""},"output":"delta lines 10 ts 2026-11-13T03:18:04.250Z\n{\"ok\":true,\"receipt\":{\"ledger_id\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"sequence\":2,\"event_id\":\"event-6a00ca5a-6c64-4b46-9c59-ee296c8bcadc\",\"event_type\":\"deep-research.ledger.iteration-completed\",\"event_version\":1,\"stream_id\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"stream_sequence\":2,\"committed_at\":\"2026-11-13T03:18:04.879Z\",\"canonicalEventHash\":\"51f4515fb832d3d5b0647fbf9f84d7999c5f824aeac4a506dd51dc526114b47e\",\"recordHash\":\"c72e7270c2a91066acaa6da64e18cabd52b9b6a12730d88b8bb94bd8e0965913\",\"authorizationRef\":{\"audit_ledger_id\":\"deep-research-audit-ledger\",\"audit_sequence\":3,\"audit_record_hash\":\"f67a0a27fe4aba320f0a271fb96476a12629a51ad2bbbcf748c3ebcaa124ccda\",\"decision_id\":\"decision-a1b542e8-8fa8-4f94-9084-36b7fb654eae\",\"decision_digest\":\"e0774dc502cebf0123d6208fb6b8681f0b5aaf441e89a71691c00c82317cf088\",\"request_digest\":\"614a98935fb285f2541f8616c4fa9cd95c89a243dceb41aa8501b5207947156a\",\"policy_digest\":\"a4b1c20c36f40aa5f6c82a50e7fb20354deda901fb7b2be8f51dc112f221c7dd\",\"authority_epoch\":1,\"fence_token\":2},\"ledgerId\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"eventId\":\"event-6a00ca5a-6c64-4b46-9c59-ee296c8bcadc\",\"eventType\":\"deep-research.ledger.iteration-completed\",\"eventVersion\":1,\"streamId\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"streamSequence\":2,\"committedAt\":\"2026-11-13T03:18:04.879Z\"},\"projectionRefreshed\":true,\"projectionError\":null,\"warnings\":[\"Trusted evidence yield was absent and remains explicitly zero.\"]}\nEXIT=0\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"delta lines 10 ts 2026-11-13T03:18:04.250Z\n{\"ok\":true,\"receipt\":{\"ledger_id\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"sequence\":2,\"event_id\":\"event-6a00ca5a-6c64-4b46-9c59-ee296c8bcadc\",\"event_type\":\"deep-research.ledger.iteration-completed\",\"event_version\":1,\"stream_id\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"stream_sequence\":2,\"committed_at\":\"2026-11-13T03:18:04.879Z\",\"canonicalEventHash\":\"51f4515fb832d3d5b0647fbf9f84d7999c5f824aeac4a506dd51dc526114b47e\",\"recordHash\":\"c72e7270c2a91066acaa6da64e18cabd52b9b6a12730d88b8bb94bd8e0965913\",\"authorizationRef\":{\"audit_ledger_id\":\"deep-research-audit-ledger\",\"audit_sequence\":3,\"audit_record_hash\":\"f67a0a27fe4aba320f0a271fb96476a12629a51ad2bbbcf748c3ebcaa124ccda\",\"decision_id\":\"decision-a1b542e8-8fa8-4f94-9084-36b7fb654eae\",\"decision_digest\":\"e0774dc502cebf0123d6208fb6b8681f0b5aaf441e89a71691c00c82317cf088\",\"request_digest\":\"614a98935fb285f2541f8616c4fa9cd95c89a243dceb41aa8501b5207947156a\",\"policy_digest\":\"a4b1c20c36f40aa5f6c82a50e7fb20354deda901fb7b2be8f51dc112f221c7dd\",\"authority_epoch\":1,\"fence_token\":2},\"ledgerId\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"eventId\":\"event-6a00ca5a-6c64-4b46-9c59-ee296c8bcadc\",\"eventType\":\"deep-research.ledger.iteration-completed\",\"eventVersion\":1,\"streamId\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"streamSequence\":2,\"committedAt\":\"2026-11-13T03:18:04.879Z\"},\"projectionRefreshed\":true,\"projectionError\":null,\"warnings\":[\"Trusted evidence yield was absent and remains explicitly zero.\"]}\nEXIT=0\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && L=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2 && node -e '\\nconst fs=require(\\\"fs\\\"); const L=process.argv[1];\\nconst ts=new Date().toISOString();\\nconst id=\\\"fanout-cross-cli-2-1794539443568-6stapj\\\";\\nconst q1=\\\"Which runtime loses the Gate 2 policy before the model sees it, and which single file per runtime decides that: Codex\\\\x27s hook approval key, Claude\\\\x27s instruction file, or the shared session readers?\\\";\\nconst it={type:\\\"iteration\\\",iteration:1,runId:id,sessionId:id,lineageId:id,run:1,mode:\\\"research\\\",target_agent:\\\"deep-research\\\",agent_definition_loaded:true,resolved_route:\\\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\\\",status:\\\"complete\\\",focus:\\\"Q1: which runtime loses the Gate 2 policy before the model sees it, and which single file per runtime decides that (Codex hook approval key, Claude instruction file, shared session readers)\\\",findingsCount:7,newInfoRatio:0.80,noveltyJustification:\\\"5 of 7 findings are fully new and 2 are partially new against segment one (the offer-vs-delivery conflation and the arena pointer timestamp); the ratio is (5 + 1.0) / 7 = 0.86 before the cap, reported as 0.80 with the 6-row Claude negative counted as partial evidence\\\",answeredQuestions:[q1],keyQuestions:[q1],ruledOut:[\\\"Add a project CLAUDE.md and the Claude start rate rises\\\",\\\"Codex declined two offered commands\\\",\\\"Pi delivery is already proven in the committed arm\\\"],focusTrack:\\\"delivery-reachability\\\",edgeCase:\\\"contradictory-evidence\\\",toolsUsed:[\\\"Read\\\",\\\"Grep\\\",\\\"Glob\\\",\\\"Bash\\\"],sourcesQueried:[\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-embed.cjs\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/codex-hook-approval-check.cjs\\\",\\\"INSTALL-SKILLED.md\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-g2.jsonl\\\"],timestamp:ts,durationMs:900000,graphEvents:[]};\\nconst findings=[\\n [\\\"f-iter001-001\\\",\\\"The default external install deletes the only instruction file Claude Code reads: agents-md-embed folds CLAUDE.md into AGENTS.md and removes it unless --keep-claude-md, and INSTALL-SKILLED.md step 2 runs embed by default, so a project installed that way has no CLAUDE.md and Claude Code never loads AGENTS.md Gate 2.\\\",[\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-embed.cjs:92\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-embed.cjs:101\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-embed.cjs:111\\\",\\\"INSTALL-SKILLED.md:146\\\"]],\\n [\\\"f-iter001-002\\\",\\\"The doctor check engine itself says CLAUDE.md is the only instruction file when AGENTS.md is absent, which is the same fact the after arm measured from the other side.\\\",[\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs:217\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/agents-md-check.cjs:224\\\"]],\\n [\\\"f-iter001-003\\\",\\\"This repository has no root CLAUDE.md and only the post-claude arena carries one, an 11-byte @AGENTS.md pointer created at 02:53 before the 04:13 g2 run, so the g2 Claude rows are the first rows whose prompt could load the Gate 2 bullet.\\\",[\\\"/private/var/folders/3c/zfqcqsts0kn19cgblj82gqhm0000gn/T/skilled-behaviour-arenas/post-claude/CLAUDE.md:1\\\"]],\\n [\\\"f-iter001-004\\\",\\\"With the bullet reachable, the g2 arm scores Claude start 0 of 6 with 0 COMMAND lines and 2 writes, against Pi start 4 of 6 with 3 COMMAND lines on the same six rows, so restoring the instruction file is necessary for reach but not sufficient for a start.\\\",[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-g2.jsonl\\\"]],\\n [\\\"f-iter001-005\\\",\\\"Codex approval is keyed by <root>/.codex/hooks.json:user_prompt_submit:<group>:<index> with a trusted_hash in $CODEX_HOME/config.toml, and the behaviour runner inherits the operator environment unchanged, so an arena approval is an interactive operator step at that exact path.\\\",[\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/codex-hook-approval-check.cjs:80\\\",\\\".skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/codex-hook-approval-check.cjs:123\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/run-command-behaviour.mjs:814\\\"]],\\n [\\\"f-iter001-006\\\",\\\"The scorer counts a Codex offer from offeredCommand, which is produced by replaying the hook inside the checkout rather than by reading what the runtime delivered, so the after arm reads offered 2 and started 0 of 2 for Codex although briefDelivered is unknown for all 24 rows and the goal log records 0 of 24 delivered.\\\",[\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/score-command-transcripts.mjs:1079\\\",\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\\\"]],\\n [\\\"f-iter001-007\\\",\\\"briefDelivered is true for 24 of 144 after-arm rows, all Claude, and unknown for the other 120; Pi has a delivery branch and a reader, yet its 24 committed rows still read unknown, so the committed log cannot prove delivery for five of six runtimes.\\\",[\\\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/007-per-runtime-behaviour-proof/scratch/runs-post-final.jsonl\\\",\\\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/scripts/routing-accuracy/command-offer.mjs:162\\\"]]\\n];\\nconst lines=[JSON.stringify(it)];\\nfindings.forEach(([fid,label,sources],i)=>lines.push(JSON.stringify({type:\\\"finding\\\",id:fid,severity:i===0?\\\"P1\\\":\\\"P2\\\",label,iteration:1,sources})));\\nlines.push(JSON.stringify({type:\\\"ruled_out\\\",direction:\\\"Add a project CLAUDE.md and the Claude start rate rises.\\\",reason:\\\"The g2 arm had the @AGENTS.md pointer and still started 0 of 6; the fix restores reach, not a measured start gain.\\\",iteration:1}));\\nlines.push(JSON.stringify({type:\\\"ruled_out\\\",direction:\\\"Codex declined two offered commands.\\\",reason:\\\"offeredCommand is a hook replay in the checkout, not a record of what Codex delivered; briefDelivered is unknown for all 24 Codex rows.\\\",iteration:1}));\\nfs.writeFileSync(L+\\\"/deltas/iter-001.jsonl\\\",lines.join(\\\"\\\\n\\\")+\\\"\\\\n\\\");\\nfs.writeFileSync(L+\\\"/logs/iter-001-event.json\\\",JSON.stringify(it));\\nconsole.log(\\\"delta lines\\\",lines.length,\\\"ts\\\",ts);\\n' \\\"$L\\\" && node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory \\\"$L\\\" --event-json \\\"$L/logs/iter-001-event.json\\\"; echo \\\"EXIT=$?\\\"\"}"},"time":{"start":1794539877623,"end":1794539885121}}}}
