{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794540031776,"sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc256ffeoTwd6NrNr3Yljs","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2ebcd6e002Nvs6sQiqp1mxhK","sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc256ffeoTwd6NrNr3Yljs","messageID":"msg_1d2ebc375001KpE9Loq5A0jdQh","type":"tool","id":"call_00_g6zeHcXEM0P9A7dbRq3C5430","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && diff <(cat ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md) <(cat /private/var/folders/3c/zfqcqsts0kn19cgblj82gqhm0000gn/T/skilled-behaviour-arenas/post-claude/AGENTS.md) | head -30"},"output":"67a68\n> - **Command in the brief.** A brief or advisor result that names a command offers its workflow beside the skill's. Take either path whole, never an improvised one. To take the command, read its document in full and follow it. `run` starts it now. `start` starts it without `:auto`, so its setup asks. `ask` offers it in one question and waits. A typed command or explicit instruction outranks the policy. Output: `COMMAND: [/name] → [started|offered|declined]`\n89c90\n< - **Skill advisor ambiguity.** When the advisor's `command-spec-kit` bridge, keyed to `/speckit:plan`, `/speckit:resume`, `/deep:research` and `/deep:review`, matches alongside `cli-*` for iteration phrases, `command-spec-kit` wins.\n---\n> - **Skill advisor ambiguity.** When the advisor's command row for `/deep:research` or `/deep:review` matches alongside `cli-*` for iteration phrases, the command row wins.\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"67a68\n> - **Command in the brief.** A brief or advisor result that names a command offers its workflow beside the skill's. Take either path whole, never an improvised one. To take the command, read its document in full and follow it. `run` starts it now. `start` starts it without `:auto`, so its setup asks. `ask` offers it in one question and waits. A typed command or explicit instruction outranks the policy. Output: `COMMAND: [/name] → [started|offered|declined]`\n89c90\n< - **Skill advisor ambiguity.** When the advisor's `command-spec-kit` bridge, keyed to `/speckit:plan`, `/speckit:resume`, `/deep:research` and `/deep:review`, matches alongside `cli-*` for iteration phrases, `command-spec-kit` wins.\n---\n> - **Skill advisor ambiguity.** When the advisor's command row for `/deep:research` or `/deep:review` matches alongside `cli-*` for iteration phrases, the command row wins.\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && diff <(cat ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md) <(cat /private/var/folders/3c/zfqcqsts0kn19cgblj82gqhm0000gn/T/skilled-behaviour-arenas/post-claude/AGENTS.md) | head -30\"}"},"time":{"start":1794540031342,"end":1794540031776}}}}
