{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794540072993,"sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc256ffeoTwd6NrNr3Yljs","part":{"partID":"prt_1d2ec57f20015HQKvwOp8i5D4V","sessionID":"ses_e2d1cc256ffeoTwd6NrNr3Yljs","messageID":"msg_1d2ec4fc60013Ba11FV4mf3OJh","type":"tool","id":"call_00_ET_fxCYPd6O24y1qzHsl9jE9915","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && L=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2 && node -e '\nconst fs=require(\"fs\"); const L=process.argv[1];\nconst ts=new Date().toISOString(); const id=\"fanout-cross-cli-2-1794539443568-6stapj\";\nconst q5=\"Which change per runtime raises measured starts for the least risk to the floors (typed recall 24 of 44, false offers 0 of 35, scorer [159,50,20,5])?\";\nconst it={type:\"iteration\",iteration:4,runId:id,sessionId:id,lineageId:id,run:4,mode:\"research\",target_agent:\"deep-research\",agent_definition_loaded:true,resolved_route:\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",status:\"complete\",focus:\"Q5: rank the cross-cli-2 changes by expected gain per unit of risk and name the file, gain, verify and floor risk for each\",findingsCount:5,newInfoRatio:0.75,noveltyJustification:\"3 of 5 findings are fully new (the pointer proof, the check-comment contradiction, the discarded decision-line states) and 1 is partially new (the ranked table reuses earlier findings); the +0.10 synthesis bonus is not added because the ranking narrows the list rather than opening a new model\",answeredQuestions:[q5],keyQuestions:[q5],ruledOut:[\"Rank the Claude instruction-file fix as a start-rate gain\",\"Rank delivery proof below the instruction-file fix\",\"Fix Codex by pre-seeding the approval hash\"],focusTrack:\"recommendation-ranking\",edgeCase:\"contradictory-evidence\",toolsUsed:[\"Read\",\"Bash\",\"Grep\"],sourcesQueried:[\"/Users/michelk