a Codex unapproved-arm preflight, (4) loop-without-init in the safety floor, (5) decision-line state parsing; none of the five touches typed recall or false offers.\",[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/iterations/iteration-004.md\"]],\n [\"f-iter004-005\",\"Two changes should not be built: raising the COMMAND line rate buys no start and costs brief bytes, and delivery work cannot remove the four unsafe rows because all four had no offer.\",[\"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/009-ux-performance-cross-cli-research/research/lineages/cross-cli-2/iterations/iteration-003.md\"]]\n];\nconst lines=[JSON.stringify(it)];\nfindings.forEach(([fid,label,sources],i)=>lines.push(JSON.stringify({type:\"finding\",id:fid,severity:i<2?\"P1\":\"P2\",label,iteration:4,sources})));\nlines.push(JSON.stringify({type:\"ruled_out\",direction:\"Rank the Claude instruction-file fix as a start-rate gain.\",reason:\"The pointer was present and proven loaded in the g2 arm, which started 0 of 6.\",iteration:4}));\nlines.push(JSON.stringify({type:\"ruled_out\",direction:\"Fix Codex by pre-seeding the approval hash.\",reason:\"The hash is a product trust control; the ranked change makes the arm honest instead.\",iteration:4}));\nfs.writeFileSync(L+\"/deltas/iter-004.jsonl\",lines.join(\"\\n\")+\"\\n\");\nfs.writeFileSync(L+\"/logs/iter-004-event.json\",JSON.stringify(it));\nconsole.log(\"delta lines\",lines.length,\"ts\",ts);\n' \"$L\" && node .skilled/skills/system-deep-loop/runtime/scripts/append-mode-event.cjs --mode research --run-directory \"$L\" --event-json \"$L/logs/iter-004-event.json\" | tail -2; echo \"EXIT=$?\""},"output":"delta lines 8 ts 2026-11-13T03:21:12.145Z\n{\"ok\":true,\"receipt\":{\"ledger_id\":\"deep-research-ledger\",\"sequence\":5,\"event_id\":\"event-c166d602-6905-4287-a105-99f7029b8639\",\"event_type\":\"deep-research.ledg